 "description": "<p>A red plush slip with the bows doing the work: headband, neck ring, and dress in one set, one size for 40-60 kg. Chiffon base, so the plush is a finish rather than the whole hand-feel.</p>\n<p>The slip cut is the easiest wearing format in costume lingerie - one line from shoulder to hem, nothing to adjust mid-evening. Headband and neck ring add the holiday styling that a plain slip cannot.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: chiffon with plush trim</li>\n<li>Includes: headband, neck ring, dress</li>\n<li>Style: Christmas slip</li>\n<li>Color: red</li>\n<li>Sizing: one size, recommended 40-60 kg</li>\n</ul>\n<p>One size for 40-60 kg. Red, bowed, and simple - the low-effort high-effect entry in the Christmas category.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Red plush bow slip dress with headband and neck ring, one size for 40-60 kg, chiffon Christmas set.</p>\n",
